{"ref":"BDB, יְהוֹחָנָן","hw":"יְהוֹחָנָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹחָנָן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹחָנָן</span></big>  † <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹחָנָן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹחָנָן</span></big> <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊 mostly Ἰωαναν, Ἰωναν <strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>hath been gracious</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֶלְחָנָן\" href=\"/BDB,_אֶלְחָנָן\", dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְחָנָן</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֲנַנְאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲנַנְאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">חֲנַנְאֵל</a> & reff.; also Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">יחנבעל בעליחן</span><strong>)</strong>—<br/><br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> a priest <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.13\">Ne 12:13</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  high priest <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:6\" href=\"/Ezra.10.6\">Ezr 10:6</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹחָנָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.22\">Ne 12:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.23\">23</a> appar. = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹנָתָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.11\">Ne 12:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (𝔊 Ἰωναθαν).<br/><br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> Levite <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.42\">Ne 12:42</a>.<br/><br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> son of Tobiah <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.18\">Ne 6:18</a> (𝔊 Codd. Ἰωναθαν).<br/><br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> porter in David’s time <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.3\">1 Ch 26:3</a> (𝔊 Ἰωνας, 𝔊L Ἰωναθαν).<br/><br><strong>5.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> a Judaite captain <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.15\">2 Ch 17:15</a> appar. also <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.1\">23:1</a>.<br/><br><strong>6.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> an Ephraimite <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.12\">2 Ch 28:12</a>.<br/><br><strong>7.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> an Israelite, Ezra’s time <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:28\" href=\"/Ezra.10.28\">Ezr 10:28</a>.<br/><br><strong>8.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> (& so all foll.) a Jewish captain, after fall of Jerus. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.23\">2 K 25:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.8\">Je 40:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.11\">41:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.1\">42:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.2\">43:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.5\">5</a><br/><br><strong>9.</strong>  eldest son of king Josiah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.15\">1 Ch 3:15</a> 𝔊L ͂Ἰωαχας (appar. = <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹאָחָז</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:30\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.30\">2 K 23:30</a> +).<br><strong>10.</strong>  a post-exilic prince of the line of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.24\">1 Ch 3:24</a>.<br><strong>11.</strong>  father of Azariah, priest in Sol.’s time <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.35\">1 Ch 5:35</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.36\">36</a>.<br><strong>12.</strong>  two of David’s mighty men: <strong>a.</strong>  a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.5\">1 Ch 12:5</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  a Gadite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.13\">1 Ch 12:13</a>.<br><strong>13.</strong>  a returning exile <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:12\" href=\"/Ezra.8.12\">Ezr 8:12</a>.","next":"BDB, יְהוֹיָדָע","prev":"BDB, יְהוֹזָבָד"}